    {"type": "text", "id": "size_text", "x": 32, "y": 400, "width": 670, "height": 126, "text": "keys x bytes per key       = memory\n  10 M x <phase 03 MEMORY USAGE>\nrequests/s x ops/request   = Redis ops/s\n  50 k x 1 EVALSHA\nRedis ops/s / per-shard max = primaries\n  50 k / <phase 04 measured>", "originalText": "keys x bytes per key       = memory\n  10 M x <phase 03 MEMORY USAGE>\nrequests/s x ops/request   = Redis ops/s\n  50 k x 1 EVALSHA\nRedis ops/s / per-shard max = primaries\n  50 k / <phase 04 measured>", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "roughness": 0},

