    {"type": "text", "id": "qa_text", "x": 772, "y": 400, "width": 694, "height": 126, "text": "two replicas read the same count?  Lua      03\nserver clocks differ?              TIME     03\nRedis is down?                     breaker  03\none key gets 1,000 req/s?          split    04\nclients retry in a storm?          jitter   02\nwhy not only nginx?                per-node 05", "originalText": "two replicas read the same count?  Lua      03\nserver clocks differ?              TIME     03\nRedis is down?                     breaker  03\none key gets 1,000 req/s?          split    04\nclients retry in a storm?          jitter   02\nwhy not only nginx?                per-node 05", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "roughness": 0}
